PocketManga Java runtime

runtime/jre is OpenJDK 17.0.20.1+1 built from source for the Verse by
tools/jre in the PocketManga repository: the jdk17u GA tag, cross-compiled
with GCC 13.4.0 against the bundle's selected glibc profile (2.23 or 2.39,
recorded in runtime/packages.json). It runs on the reader's own C library;
no C library is bundled. OpenJDK's licenses (GPL-2.0 with the Classpath
Exception, and third-party notices) are in runtime/jre/legal.

libjvm.so statically links GCC 13.4.0's libstdc++ and libgcc:
GPL-3.0-or-later with the GCC Runtime Library Exception 3.1, in
licenses/gcc-runtime.

runtime/jre/lib/client/classes.jsa is a class-data-sharing archive generated
from the runtime itself.

PocketManga statically links SQLite 3.54.1, built from the official
amalgamation pinned in zig-tachi/build.zig.zon. SQLite is in the public domain:
https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html
